    "detailed_description": "<strong>Pure Hearts is a social-oriented MMORPG with sandbox elements</strong>.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/63d5ddc0a83438b23a1ea698dabcecca.avif?t=1726769565\" width=617 height=177 /></span><br>This is a fantasy world where players join their forces in one of the world cities in order to gain wealth and influence.<br><br><strong>Game World Map:</strong> the game world contains many varied locations which are connected to each other through the global world map. Discover unique biomes and claim their resources!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/3df52ae3a7bb47dd67d5ee8bdb2ad385.avif?t=1726769565\" width=617 height=177 /></span><br><strong>Random events:</strong> the game world is not static, new event locations appear every day. Who knows what kind of treasures can be found there?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/2873481b405493bbc60879dde4de70a4.avif?t=1726769565\" width=617 height=177 /></span><br><strong>Combat:</strong> the game has a decent combat system with blocks, parries and feints. Hone your fighting skills to become the finest fencer!<br><br><strong>Cities:</strong> the player can become the citizen of one of the world's cities or they may choose to stay as an independent traveler. The city provides facilities to its citizens such as a marketplace, warehouses, craft stations and much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/d7c4ab00cda8086c5240eb5f4ea54616.avif?t=1726769565\" width=617 height=177 /></span><br><strong>Clans:</strong> gather your friends and create a clan to claim your authority within the city\u2019s walls. Defend your city from the invaders or conquer other cities in clan wars!<br><br><strong>Gather resources, create goods, trade, fight and live in the world of Pure Hearts!</strong>",
